+# v31 — Gem Spy and persistent observation histories
+
+- Tabs are Map Tweaker, Gem Sniper and Gem Spy. The Gem Watch tab and its
+  background watcher are no longer constructed. Detection sensitivity, HUD
+  masking and sound preferences migrate from the existing settings file and
+  are available in Gem Sniper settings. Existing standard history is retained.
+- Spy uses the selected Sniper route and applicable settings, with its own
+  Start/Resume, Stop/F10, status, Time spent and unique Gems found counter.
+  There are no Spy route selectors, editors or settings dialogs. Only one
+  route controller owns mouse delivery at a time.
+- Spy checks and repeats the route without gem clicks, approach movement or
+  stop-on-find. Multiple confirmed gems in a view can be recorded separately.
+- Standard history keeps Spotted, Source and Match score. New Spy rows show
+  Gem Spy and link the original screenshot. The exclusive Spy history keeps
+  visits, last-empty/first-seen appearance windows, last seen, first missing,
+  runs observed and the same photo. Continuing gems add no extra image or row.
+- Two clear empty visits in separate runs confirm disappearance; uncertainty
+  is not empty. Matching persists across runs/restarts and tolerates small
+  within-view shifts. Exact identity across unobserved replacement is unknown.
+- Hourly history groups distinct first-confirmed sightings by date/local hour,
+  without counting a continuing gem again at the hour boundary. Timing history
+  shows candidate minute ranges, supporting windows and observed gaps. These
+  are observations and hypotheses, not exact spawn timestamps or a proven timer.
+- Capture/alignment errors release input, retry with delay and retain counters,
+  progress and histories. After two failures a point is unclear and revisited
+  next run. Manual Stop/F10 cancels retries. A new app process restores the
+  checkpoint but waits for Start/Resume; no process-crash watchdog is installed.
+- State and new standard rows commit together in SQLite. Async image completion
+  enriches those rows. Startup recovers an already-written original photo or
+  marks it interrupted; a later screenshot is not mislabeled as the original.
+- v30 centre-start dragging, four exact control exclusions with no padding,
+  stationary release and removal of portal-coordinate restrictions remain.
+
+Exit the old app, extract the full folder and run its new LoongLens.exe. The
+header shows v31. Keep %LOCALAPPDATA%\LoongLens to retain settings, routes,
+history and Spy tracking. Windows builds and checks include native Tk and input
+on the app's own test windows, plus real detector/Spy storage with simulated
+camera delivery. They do not run BlueStacks or establish actual spawn schedules.
